From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Wed, 11 Nov 2026 12:09:38 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Admin gate: lock out password guessing, refuse cross-site
 requests

From a security review of the Worker (Nov 11, 2026).

- 10 wrong admin passwords from one IP in 15 minutes locks that IP out
  for the rest of the window. Before, guessing was unlimited.
- The admin password is compared in constant time.
- A request that changes something is refused when another site started
  it (Origin / Sec-Fetch-Site). A browser signed in to the dashboard
  sends its saved password with every request, so another page could
  have paused a client or changed levels.
- Error detail goes only to a signed-in admin. Strangers no longer see
  internal error messages.

New test_admin_gate.mjs (17 checks); all suites pass.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>
